{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熊本県を中心とした九州地方の大地震\nいまだに余震が続いており\n不安な日々を過ごされていると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この２日間、握手会場にて\n熊本地震の義援金の募金箱を\n設置させて頂いたのですが、\nご協力して下さった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ何か出来る事はないか、\n微力ならも探したいと思います。\nそして、１日も早く元の生活を\n送れる日が来る事を願っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、一昨日は握手会でした！\n久しぶりの握手会でかなりワクワクな\n気持ちで臨めました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会のペアはまいちゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/18/8538970/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんとは研究生のときの\nペア握手以来でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんファンの皆様\nみりり委員会の皆様\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会では1.2部と早い\n部だったので皆さん眠たそうな\n顔で来てたのでなんか違う一面\n見ちゃった感じがして楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一部はお団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/18/8538970/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/18/8538970/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年に1回くらいしかやらない\nザ・お団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部はポニーテール〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/18/8538970/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/04/18/8538970/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身とれなかった、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりだからこそいろいろな\nお話ができたと思うし\nじょしらくおめでとう！や\n2期生3周年おめでとう！\nたくさんのおめでとう頂いて\n私は本当に幸せ者です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、これからも\n宜しくお願いいたします(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎質問返し（仮）◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・寝る前にすることなに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→音楽を聴いて頭を空っぽに\nさせることですかね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく落ち着くんですよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・親に誕プレゼントあげるとしたら\n何をプレゼントしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→電動歯ブラシの新しいのを\n今度のお誕生日に買うつもりです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は好きな物は先に食べる？\n最後に食べる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→最後に食べる派です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最近気付いたんですけど\n好きではないものを先に食べると\nそれでお腹が満たされて\n結局好きなものが食べれない〜\nなんて事があるのでどうすればいいんだろう\nって考え中です(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛の部屋はどんな部屋？\n何色ベースにしてるのかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→シンプルですよ(^ ^)\n家具類は全て白で、カーテンは淡いイエロー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・おれ全く虫とか触れないんだけど\nみり愛触れる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→見るのも嫌だし触るなんて\n絶対無理です＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の逆質問の「みりあんさー」を\n質問返しの題名にした方が！！\nと言う意見もあって悩んだのですが、\n集計の結果のままにしますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名だけでもこんなに\n考えて頂いてすごく嬉しいです\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しの題名"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"①みりタイム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"②みりターン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"③みりトーク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいと思った番号を教えて下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしてます(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に気合を入れる方法は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多かった順に紹介していきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 好きな曲を聴く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位 大声を出す"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 ビンタ、背中を叩いてもらう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4位 エナジードリンク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5位 筋トレ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位の好きな曲を聴くは\n実際に私もやっています(^ ^)\nやっぱり落ち着くんですよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背中を叩いてもらうは\nライブが始まる前にいつもメンバーで\n背中を叩き合っています！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のマイブームは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにてお待ちしております〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術館や展覧会！！\n教えて頂きありがとうございました！\n全部メモしたので、\nお休みの時にでも行ってきます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーて！明日から\nアンダーライブ東北ツアーです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}